\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 1. Overview\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Jersey Pickles is a small, family-owned e-commerce business that produces and sells pickles and fermented foods through its online store, www.jerseypickles.com. We are building a simple internal command-line tool for keyword research and search term analysis for our own Google Ads campaigns. The tool is for internal use only: it will be used exclusively by the business owner, on our own Google Ads accounts, and will never be sold, licensed, white-labeled, or made available to third parties.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 2. Purpose and Use Cases\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Keyword discovery:
\f1\b0  Generate new keyword ideas for our product categories (pickles, fermented vegetables, gift jars) using seed keywords and our website URL.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Search volume and seasonality analysis:
\f1\b0  Retrieve historical monthly search volume metrics to plan seasonal campaigns (e.g., holiday gift season).\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Search term mining:
\f1\b0  Review search term reports from our own existing campaigns to identify new keywords to add and negative keywords to exclude.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Forecasting (optional):
\f1\b0  Estimate clicks and cost before launching new ad groups.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 3. Google Ads API Services Used\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 KeywordPlanIdeaService.GenerateKeywordIdeas
\f1\b0  \'e2\'80\'94 keyword ideas from seed keywords and site URL, segmented by geography (United States / New Jersey) and language (English).\
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 KeywordPlanIdeaService.GenerateKeywordHistoricalMetrics
\f1\b0  \'e2\'80\'94 12-month search volume, competition, and CPC ranges for candidate keywords.\
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 GoogleAdsService.SearchStream (GAQL)
\f1\b0  \'e2\'80\'94 read-only reporting queries against 
\f2\i search_term_view
\f1\i0 , 
\f2\i keyword_view
\f1\i0 , and 
\f2\i campaign
\f1\i0  for our own account.\
\ls2\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 KeywordPlanService / GenerateKeywordForecastMetrics
\f1\b0  \'e2\'80\'94 optional forecasts before launching new campaigns.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 4. Architecture and Data Flow\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 The tool is a set of Python scripts using the official 
\f0\b google-ads
\f1\b0  Python client library, run manually from a single desktop computer (macOS).\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The script authenticates via OAuth 2.0 (desktop application flow) with a refresh token stored locally in a 
\f2\i google-ads.yaml
\f1\i0  configuration file.\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The script calls the Google Ads API services listed above through the manager account 529-427-5854, accessing only our linked client account (488-882-3590).\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Results (keywords, search volume, competition, CPC ranges) are written to local CSV files for review by the owner.\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Selected keywords are then added to campaigns manually through the Google Ads web interface.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Expected API usage is very low: a few hundred requests per month at most, run manually and on demand. There is no server component, no scheduled/automated mutation of campaigns, no storage of end-user data, and no data sharing with any third party.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 5. Users and Access\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Internal users only: the business owner (one person). API credentials (developer token, OAuth client credentials, refresh token) are stored locally on the owner's computer and are not distributed. The tool has no user interface exposed to the public and no external users.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 6. Compliance\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 The tool accesses only accounts owned by Jersey Pickles under manager account 529-427-5854. We will comply with the Google Ads API Terms of Service and Required Minimum Functionality guidelines applicable to internal reporting tools. Reporting data is not co-mingled, resold, or shared.\
}